title: Sophos Firewall: Licenses
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/sophos
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 Subscription status and expiry date of all license modules in one service
 (sfosXGLicenseDetails). The worst module determines the state; modules with a
 problem are named in the summary, the next expiring module and its remaining
 time are always shown.
 Expired: {CRIT}. No longer subscribed, deactivated or no longer reported: {WARN}.
 Default levels for the remaining time: {WARN} below 30 days, {CRIT} below 14 days.
 Modules with an expiry date in the year 2999 or later (e.g. Base Firewall) are
 perpetual. Single modules can be ignored. Configurable via the rule
 "Sophos Firewall licenses".

discovery:
 One service is created if at least one module is subscribed or in evaluation.
 These modules are stored with the service; rediscover after license changes.
